 "source_tables_notes": "Sources per EWAR kind: from module (active, any listed effect; Pyfa counts a module once per matching effect name), drone (per active drone) or fighter ability (active). strength is evaluated on the item (a.<attr> = modified attribute, cycle_s = average cycle s, squadron = fighters in squadron) and multiplied by (1 - p.resist). range: module = Pyfa maxRange/falloff attributes, doomsday = maxRange + doomsdayAOERange (no lock), inf. lock/dcr: needs lock range / drone control range unless the setting ignores it. sum_sources_<t>() = sum of strength x range factor; stack_sources_<t>() = stacking-penalised product of (1 + strength x rf / 100)."
}